# Shared Navigation

- Every page uses five dock destinations in this order: Home, Works, GitHub, Xiaohongshu, About.
- Keep icons, spacing, sizes, separators, tooltips, hover motion and link behavior consistent.
- Only the GitHub section uses the dark dock palette; other pages use the shared light palette.
- Preserve the original circular About icon and an internal link to `/workbook/about/`.
- Articles belong to Home and must keep the Home icon active. Only the independent `/workbook/crafts/` page selects Works, including its preview dialogs.
- Check the dock after React hydration and after navigating into an article. Static HTML checks alone missed a four-item legacy renderer that displaced About.
- Implement navigation changes in both the build output and client renderer. Run `npm run check` and verify browser navigation before publishing.
